  "question": {
    "text": "Element &quot;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math>&quot; belongs to the period&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> and group <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>16</mn></math> of the periodic table. The valence shell electron configuration of the element, which is just above &quot;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></math>&quot; in the group is",
